      "message": "\"applied\" maybe ?\n\nI think it must be crystal clear, like on the previous patch, that this network may have disconnected by the time the report is sent.\n\nWorse : if you keep a ref to it forever, it\u0027s possible a different Network is actually #equals() to it. This is generally true of the entire surface and it takes a sufficient amount of time for network IDs to be reused for this never to be a problem in practice so I don\u0027t think we need to call this out.\n\nBut I think it must be clear that this network is under no obligation to still be connected.",
